    "group": "Kauyon",
    "summary": "In battle rounds 3, 4 and 5, ranged weapons of your **T'AU EMPIRE** models get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n\nIn those battle rounds, whenever a model in a Guided unit (as [For the Greater Good](vsdata:ability/tau-empire.for-the-greater-good) defines it) makes a ranged attack against a Spotted unit, the attack can ignore some or all of the modifiers to its BS, every modifier to its [Hit roll](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls), or both.",
